@startuml
autonumber
actor User
participant "React Client" as Client
participant "Flask API" as Backend
participant "OCR / AI Engine" as AI
database "MongoDB" as DB

User -> Client: Upload Lab Report (PDF/Image)
Client -> Backend: POST /api/reports/upload
Backend -> AI: Forward document for OCR extraction
AI --> Backend: Return extracted tests, values, and units
Backend -> Backend: Compare with reference ranges & flag anomalies
Backend --> Client: Return structured review draft
User -> Client: Verify / edit values and submit
Client -> Backend: POST /api/reports/confirm
Backend -> DB: Persist structured biometric records
DB --> Backend: Write confirmed
Backend --> Client: Return updated timeline data
@enduml
